<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Willbros started by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Willbros started by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of Willbros Group Inc as near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Friday at 9-5/8.</p>
</text>
